  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-10-05T15:41:49.528Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes I'm in a large world and can't find a friend. Or we got separated. \n\nSometimes I wish I could just send a quick hello message to a friend without having to join the world.\n\nIt would be nice if we had premade alerts we could send them. \n\nFor example, I see a friend is online. I click their profile and click a \"send hello message\" button. \n\nIf we we are in the same world, and get separated a \"Meet me at spawn\" button would be nice. Or a button to make them easily visible over great distances. A pulsating wave or sound. Hot/Cold meter. \n\nBasically I'm asking for a way to send quick msgs to people in game to say hello or find them.",
